flowchart LR
    HUMAN[Human owner] -->|first Tailscale + bot enrollment| GATEWAY
    SURFACE[Discord / Slack / Telegram / other Hermes surface] --> GATEWAY

    subgraph ZONE[Owning Station Zone]
        GATEWAY[Hermes Messaging Gateway]
        BRAIN[Hermes central brain<br/>session + OS Director + team]
        CREDS[Zone Hermes credentials<br/>mode 0600]
        GATEWAY --> BRAIN
        BRAIN --> GATEWAY
    end

    GATEWAY -->|ephemeral setup action| LINK[One-time station.guided_setup link]
    LINK -->|HTTPS .ts.net only| BROKER[Loopback Station setup broker]
    BROKER -->|allowlisted secret| CREDS
    BROKER -->|allowlisted redirect| AUTH[Hermes / Composio / device auth]

    AUDIO[Voice input / Discord audio] --> GATEWAY
    GATEWAY -->|primary STT| OPENAI_STT[OpenAI gpt-transcribe]
    GATEWAY -->|Discord failure only| PARAKEET[Local Parakeet<br/>127.0.0.1:5092]
    OPENAI_STT --> BRAIN
    PARAKEET --> BRAIN
    BRAIN -->|TTS| OPENAI_TTS[OpenAI gpt-4o-mini-tts]
    OPENAI_TTS --> GATEWAY
